OL,3,GNEWSAShootings down more than 77% in
OL,4,AGreater Manchester
OL,5,
OL,6,FShootings in Greater Manchester have
OL,7,Ffallen by more than three-quarters in
OL,8,Fthe past five years, police figures
OL,9,Fshow.
OL,11,FAccording to Greater Manchester Police
OL,12,F(GMP) figures, there were 16 firearms
OL,13,Fdischarges in the 12 months to April
OL,14,F2026, down from 71 in 2020-21, a fall
OL,15,Fof 77.5% over five years.
OL,17,FThe force has also recovered more than
OL,18,F420 viable weapons since April 2021. It
OL,19,Fcomes as Greater Manchester marks
OL,20,Fthree-and-a-half years without a fatal
OL,21,Fshooting in the region.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
